        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;My first crossover event. Yay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Charlie hosts the Hazbin Hotel's first Pride celebration and gets everyone to join in with the finishing touches to kick off the grand party. Who shows up to help?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just a little one shot. Everyone interacting and being together basically.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
